as and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to exceed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go past a limit"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We actually exceeded our goal by $37, 000. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to discuss the results of a charitable event."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "turnout"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the number of people who attend an event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I guess I shouldn't be surprised, the turnout was really spectacular."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to shed light on "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to clarify "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your speech really shed light on a very dire situation."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to empathize "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to understand how someone else feels"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You really did a good job of getting the audience empathize with the children of Lesotho."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tax receipt"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a piece of paper that proves money has been donated"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I really have to get these tax receipts out. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "indebted "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "extremely grateful  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I really am indebted to you for your mentorship."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le07ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le07ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " <span class=\"italic\">If</span> and Politeness"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the conditionals to talk about real or unreal possibilities in the present or future.."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In speaking, you often use <span class=\"italic\">if</span> followed by <span class=\"italic\">will</span>,<span class=\"italic\"> would</span>, <span class=\"italic\">can </span>or <span class=\"italic\">could </span>to introduce a polite request:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">If we can</span> move on to the next point for discussion. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">If I could </span>just say one more thing ... </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">If you will </span>follow me, please. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart for some other expressions with <span class=\"italic\">if </span>to express politeness:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Phrase\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you don't mind ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you don't mind, I'll turn off the heat. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If it's OK with you ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'll wait here, if it's OK with you.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If I may say so ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If I may say so, you look amazing in that dress! </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If I can ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If I can help, I would be happy to. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you would ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If you would come this way, your table is over here. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Amazing, if I may say so myself!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you don't mind, I'd like to use you as our official spokesperson."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Degrees of Necessity"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use modals to express necessity. Each modal implies varying degrees of necessity."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Look at the chart below for information about each modal and the degree of necessity it implies:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Meaning/Degree of Necessity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"must\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" very strong necessity; often use for subjective necessity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"must + verb <br/> (Negative form <span class=\\\"italic\\\">mustn't </span>changes meaning to prohibition)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I guess you must be a little bit disappointed.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" have to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" strong necessity; often used for necessities imposed on us\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have to + verb <br/>didn't have to + verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I really have to get these tax receipts out.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" have got to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" more casual for strong necessity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have go to + verb  <br/>Not used in questions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> You have got to take some time to celebrate.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"should\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" obligation; subjective opinion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"should + verb <br/>Past: should + have + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I guess I shouldn't be surprised, the turnout was really spectacular.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" ought to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" obligation; objective opinion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ought + to + verb <br/>Past: ought to + have + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> You ought to take some of the credit.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" shall\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" formal rules and regulations\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shall + verb <br/>No past tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> A receipt shall be issued for any donation exceeding $10.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose an international cause (i.e. save the whales, poaching in Kenya, homeless in New York City)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find at least ten statistics to show why supporting your chosen cause is necessary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "On a blank piece of paper, create an infographic (sentences and pictures) displaying your statistics."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present your statistics to a classmate."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research an international cause."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I record statistics."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I create an infographic about a social issue."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present my infographic to a classmate."}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le07ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le07ob07re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le07ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: Amy! Just the person I was looking for. If you could follow me, please.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Right behind you.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: So, did you hear the numbers from the auction?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Yeah, I guess you must be a little bit disappointed. I heard someone say $37, 000. Not bad, but not exact--", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le07ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: If I can interject for a moment. We didn't raise $37, 000, we actually exceeded our goal by $37, 000. We raised $137, 000 total!\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Amazing, if I may say so myself! I guess I shouldn't be surprised, the turnout was really spectacular.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: You ought to take some of the credit. Your speech really shed light on a very dire situation. You really did a good job of getting the audience empathize with the children of Lesotho. If you don't mind, I'd like to use you as our official spokesperson.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Wow, it would be an honor.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: You have got to take some time to celebrate. Why don't you take the afternoon off?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: I ought to, but I can't. I really have to get these tax receipts out.", "id": 2, "time": "18000", "image": "engenn10le07ob07re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: I don't think you have to do that for the small donations. It's really just for the larger amounts.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Actually, if you'll take a look at this. It says right there in the tax code: \u201cA receipt shall be issued for any donation exceeding $10.\u201d\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: It looks like you're on top of things, as always. I guess that's it, then.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: If I could just add one more thing. I really am indebted to you for mentorship. You've really taught me a lot these past few weeks.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Candice</span>: It's been a pleasure having you. In fact, I don't know what we ever did without you!", "id": 3, "time": "67000", "image": "engenn10le07ob07re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about social issues and moral dilemmas."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can make polite requests using if."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express what is necessary."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " When was the last time someone or something exceeded your expectations?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " When was that last time someone or something failed to meet your expectations?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": " Let's find out how the auction went!"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nAmy gets<span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_1\"> caught off guard</span> by the results.\n\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 